    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Ship smarter keep rules: How library providers can unblock app-level DEX code optimization]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-11-17:/blog/posts/ship-smarter-keep-rules-unblock-dex-optimization</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/ship-smarter-keep-rules-unblock-dex-optimization"/>
        <updated>2026-11-17T19:25:02.091Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[As Android app and library developers, we all strive for the same goal: performant apps that provide a smooth user experience. A major part of that involves R8, Android’s app optimizer. R8 improves app performance by removing unused code, and optimizing and obfuscating the rest.
]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>Breana Tate</name>
            <uri>https://developer.android.com/blog/authors/breana-tate</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2026-11-17T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    </entry>
