    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[How SmileID Scaled Identity Verification to 18,000+ Android Device Types with CameraX]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-11-11:/blog/posts/smileid-camerax-android-identity-verification</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/smileid-camerax-android-identity-verification"/>
        <updated>2026-11-10T20:18:20.575Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Identity verification apps for banking and SIM registration require clear, high-resolution face captures to detect spoofing and deepfakes. Capturing frames sharp enough for liveness and anti-spoofing checks, without crashing low-memory devices, is a common challenge for Android camera develope]]></summary>
        <author>
            <name>Donovan McMurray</name>
            <uri>https://developer.android.com/blog/authors/donovan-mcmurray</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Powering Seamless Player Sign-In: Introducing the Open-Source Sign in with Google Plugin for Unity]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-11-10:/blog/posts/open-source-google-sign-in-unity</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/open-source-google-sign-in-unity"/>
        <updated>2026-11-10T17:35:22.231Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[With Unity powering over half of all mobile titles worldwide, first impressions matter. For game developers, a smooth, reliable player onboarding experience is essential to driving day-one retention and long-term engagement. ]]></summary>
