            <uri>https://developer.android.com/blog/authors/michelle-martin</uri>
        </author>
        <published>2026-11-10T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    </entry>
    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Build for an expanding lineup of Android XR devices with production-ready tools from Android Developer Summit]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-11-06:/blog/posts/build-android-xr-devices-tools</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/build-android-xr-devices-tools"/>
        <updated>2026-11-06T18:16:12.047Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[From full immersion at home to glanceable experiences on the go, building on Android XR lets you meet users at any moment across the entire spectrum of spatial applications. At Android Developer Summit, we marked an exciting milestone with the launch of XREAL AURA.]]></summary>
