    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[What’s new in intelligent apps at the Android Developer Summit]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-11-05:/blog/posts/android-intelligence-system-in-app-agents-ads</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/android-intelligence-system-in-app-agents-ads"/>
        <updated>2026-11-06T19:50:49.838Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[In the intelligence era, users are no longer just tapping through apps, they express high-level goals and expect AI agents like Gemini to complete multi-step workflows, sometimes across multiple apps on their devices. ]]></summary>
