        <updated>2026-11-04T16:02:17.288Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[The Android ecosystem is a multi-device reality that spans phones, foldables, tablets, wearables, in-car displays, XR, and Googlebook. In this landscape, adaptive development is foundational to reaching users wherever they are.]]></summary>
