        <updated>2026-10-28T12:53:18.882Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Android Studio Rabbit 2 is now stable and ready for you to use in production. This release includes key features to improve your development such as Bring Your Own Agent, new XR Emulator features, a LeakCanary update, a new agent skills manager tool, AI code review, and more. ]]></summary>
