        <updated>2026-10-16T16:17:27.504Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[As agentic development accelerates, Android engineering is reaching an exciting new frontier: moving from assistive code completion to agents executing end-to-end under your direction. You have total choice and flexibility in the models and agents you use. ]]></summary>
