        <title type="html"><![CDATA[New ways to drive smarter discovery, deeper engagement, and business growth on Google Play]]></title>
        <id>tag:developer.android.com,2026-10-13:/blog/posts/google-play-discovery-engagement-growth</id>
        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/google-play-discovery-engagement-growth"/>
        <updated>2026-10-15T00:46:40.417Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Today, we shared how we’re taking our “more than a store” vision into its next chapter. From You tab, now the personal home base for over 250M monthly active users, to our unified gaming platform connecting over 700M gamer profiles, Google Play is meeting users wherever they are. 
]]></summary>
