        <link href="https://developer.android.com/blog/posts/android-cli-device-streaming-and-skills"/>
        <updated>2026-10-07T17:14:00.981Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[As Android developers, you have many choices when it comes to the agents, LLMs, tools, and command-line interfaces (CLI) you use for app development. Our goal is to help you build beautiful, high-quality Android apps, no matter how you choose to build.]]></summary>
